# ============================================================
# TraderBOT — Cline ignore rules
# ============================================================
# Why this file exists (2026-10-02)
#
# The Cline extension host kept dying with
#   FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit   (1-Cline.log, exthost1)
# while the state it mirrors over gRPC was already 31.2 MB
# ("Large gRPC response: subscribeToState size=31.2MB").
#
# A part of that state comes from what the agent is allowed to
# read, and this tree is 15.7 GB of it:
#   collector/   13.7 GB      data/   1.35 GB
#   frontend/     0.5 GB      roadmap-site/ 0.14 GB
#
# Everything below is data, build output or a store — never
# source. Source and docs inside those folders stay readable on
# purpose: the agent still needs collector/crypto/*.cjs and
# roadmap-site/ROADMAP.md, so only the data is blocked.
# ============================================================

# ---------- dependencies and build output ----------
node_modules/
.next/
.turbo/
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
.git/
_legacy/
.nested-git-backup/

# ---------- the data lake ----------
data/
collector/macro/offline/
collector/macro/raw/
collector/crypto/historical/
collector/crypto/data/
collector/**/logs/
collector/**/*.db
collector/**/*.db-wal
collector/**/*.db-shm

# ---------- any file too big to belong in a chat ----------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.csv
*.ndjson
*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.zip
*.gz
*.log
